  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/graph2/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e. The item names no language. Fixture run: Python module-level `f = real_target; f()` now emits calls caller -> real_target (fixed by 1aff4e7d51, WI-gulot, 2026-07-03, after this item was filed). Still dead-ending: JS `const jf = jsTarget; jf()` -> calls to jf:variable only; Python class-body `alias = meth` -> calls to K.alias:field; local `h = real_target; h()` (Python) and `const loc = jsTarget; loc()` (JS) -> references only, no calls edge. Go package-level aliases were fixed by WI-labik (98a5b50e98). MECHANISM: alias LHS minted as a variable/field node with no continuation edge to the aliased function; only Python module scope (WI-gulot) and Go package scope (WI-labik) chase the alias. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-gulot (done), WI-labik."  # f58d
